      "content": "Shippo is a multi-carrier shipping API that enables developers to add complete shipping functionality to their applications. The API supports address validation, carrier rate comparison across USPS, UPS, FedEx, DHL, and 80+ other carriers, label generation, package tracking, returns management, and webhook notifications.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Shippo\n Email: support@goshippo.com",
